@baseUrl = http://localhost:5287

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/ping
Accept: application/json

### Process liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Neon PostgreSQL, Redis, MinIO, SMTP readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Development OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Account list (requires a valid token with the Admin role)
@adminAccessToken = replace-with-admin-access-token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Invalid pagination (400 for an authenticated Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts?pageNumber=0&pageSize=101
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json
